# Sample `syntax` case: dumps the CST of a short pipeline.
mode: syntax
---- query
orders | where amount > 10 | take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..36
  PIPELINE@0..35
    NAME_REF@0..6
      IDENT@0..6 "orders"
    WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
    PIPE@7..8 "|"
    WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
    WHERE_OP@9..26
      IDENT@9..14 "where"
      WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
      BIN_EXPR@15..26
        NAME_REF@15..21
          IDENT@15..21 "amount"
        WHITESPACE@21..22 " "
        GT@22..23 ">"
        WHITESPACE@23..24 " "
        LITERAL@24..26
          LONG@24..26 "10"
    WHITESPACE@26..27 " "
    PIPE@27..28 "|"
    WHITESPACE@28..29 " "
    TAKE_OP@29..35
      IDENT@29..33 "take"
      WHITESPACE@33..34 " "
      LITERAL@34..35
        LONG@34..35 "5"
  WHITESPACE@35..36 "\n"
